cifs: remove duplicate code in __refresh_tcon()

jira KERNEL-814
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10
commit-author Paulo Alcantara <pc@cjr.nz>
commit 8064f711c6a4614a848009b5a773e8d7f055a4c5
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.115.1.el8_10/8064f711.failed

The logic for creating or updating a cache entry in __refresh_tcon()
could be simply done with cache_refresh_path(), so use it instead.

	Signed-off-by: Paulo Alcantara (SUSE) <pc@cjr.nz>
	Signed-off-by: Steve French <stfrench@microsoft.com>
(cherry picked from commit 8064f711c6a4614a848009b5a773e8d7f055a4c5)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

